{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2026-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1784851200, "end_date": 1785542399, "month_true_total": 106, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:05:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "231725432", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136911869", "personaname": "Indoril Nerevar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198136911869/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 804, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 724, "last_played": 1785600677, "avatar": "28c5d9783ed598a5e309ed2ed49bc88f5f91bbc8"}, "language": "english", "review": "boring dlc to sniper elite 5 without any new ideas", "timestamp_created": 1785483774, "timestamp_updated": 1785483774, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231675039", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044839079", "personaname": "deadskie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/deadsky313/", "num_games_owned": 330, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 2028, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1657, "last_played": 1785516686, "avatar": "9a28bd1f5f86fe33b6d5add47ca1a9e01263d652"}, "language": "english", "review": "All in all, this is a decent SE game, but compared to previous titles, it felt underwhelming\r\n\r\nThe AI behavior is... less than perfect, often gets stuck moving 2-5 steps from position A to position B and vice versa, sometimes they'll look you in the eyes at point blank range and start running away.\r\n\r\nAny difficulty below Sniper Elite (or whatever the second-to-last one is) is kind of ridiculous, little to no threat of just running around in the open gunning everyone down. \r\n\r\nPicking items up gets wonky and sometimes you can't do it unless you find the perfect angle to approach them from\r\n\r\nThe graphic fidelity feels like a downgrade\r\n\r\nAnd last but not least; those who aren't big fans of stealth might find the campaign is rather short. Its length HEAVILY relies on the player wanting to explore the whole map and not doing a run-and-gun approach, tho I assume that's just a Sniper Elite thing\r\n\r\nI love this franchise and I wanted to love this game, but to be brutally honest, the best rating I can give it is \"okay\". It isn't bad, but it feels like a filler episode.", "timestamp_created": 1785426358, "timestamp_updated": 1785426358, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32478", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-14400F", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti", "vram_size": 8017}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231625655", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002479496", "personaname": "Spiritus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SpiritusNox/", "num_games_owned": 1039, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 832, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 832, "last_played": 1785365947, "avatar": "ccde0648731aefb3d1d32b541d14fe05e2bc195c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Essentially a level pack for 2022's Sniper Elite V - will be frustrating for those who were hoping for something more substantial, but as someone who enjoyed Sniper Elite V and had my expectations properly calibrated going into Resistance, I still quite enjoyed it for what it is. Strikes a good balance between requiring players to account for granular levels of challenge in managing sound or bullet drop or wind in precise shooting while making that all mechanically approachable. Workmanlike map and campaign design that doesn't drive me to do repeated perfectionist runs ala Hitman but are still engaging and intricate in the moment. Also you can shoot Hitler in the balls, and that is always a worthy endeavor.\n\nGets a bonus point for representing the type of B-budget Game that rarely gets made nowadays.\n\n3.5 out of 5 stars", "timestamp_created": 1785366510, "timestamp_updated": 1785366510, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32485", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900K", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER", "vram_size": 16045}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231622634", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080458344", "personaname": "wakywatson", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198080458344/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 10272, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9524, "last_played": 1786656370, "avatar": "9d4157bccf3312658016125b48d1546d229a7c3e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Easy control set up to play on PC. I like the ability to change the difficulty of the mission.  Coop games are fun to be able to share a game with friends and family and helps learn teamwork.\r\nI do like the ability for someone can join a game your playing and become the enemy. Optional.", "timestamp_created": 1785363006, "timestamp_updated": 1785363006, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": fals